flowchart TD
    A[App Launch] --> B{Authenticated user session?}
    B -- No --> C[User Access Screen\nPIN entry - simplified]
    C -->|Valid PIN| D[Home Screen]
    C -->|Invalid/locked guidance| C

    B -- Yes --> D
    D --> T[TALK\nPicture Communication]
    D --> M[MY DAY\nDaily Routines]
    D --> MED[MEDICINE\nReminders & History]
    D --> F[MY FEELINGS\nEmotion Communicator]
    D --> H[HELP ME\nSituation Assistant]
    D --> S[SOS\nEmergency]
    D --> SET[Accessibility Settings]

    T --> T1[Communication Grid\nselect tiles]
    T1 --> T2[Selected items + generated sentence]
    T2 --> T3[Speak via TTS / Replay / Clear]
    T2 --> T4[Save Favourite]
    T4 --> T5[Favourites List]

    M --> M1[Routine List - cached offline capable]
    M1 --> M2[Routine Step View\none step focused]
    M2 --> M3[Next/Previous/Repeat Voice]
    M2 --> M4[Mark Step Completed]
    M4 -->|Online| M5[Persist to server]
    M4 -->|Offline| M6[Queue pending sync\nshow pending state]
    M2 --> M7[Progress & Completion]

    MED --> MED1[Upcoming Reminders]
    MED1 --> MED2[Reminder Detail\nname + caregiver instructions]
    MED2 --> MED3[Taken / Skipped]
    MED3 --> MED4[Persist to server / sync when online]
    MED --> MED5[Medicine History]

    F --> F1[Emotion Grid]
    F1 --> F2[Message Display + Optional TTS]

    H --> H1[Situation List - predefined/custom]
    H1 --> H2[Step-by-step Guide\none step at a time]
    H2 --> H3[Repeat / Next / Previous / Restart]
    H2 --> H4[Progress]

    S --> S1[SOS Confirmation\nConfirm or Cancel]
    S1 -->|Cancel| D
    S1 -->|Confirm| S2[Request/check location permission]
    S2 --> S3[Send SOS to backend]
    S3 -->|Success| S4[Show Alert Status\nrecord id, delivery/alert status, contact]
    S3 -->|Offline/Failure| S5[Show honest failure\nnot transmitted/no false success]
    S4 --> D

    SET --> SET1[Language, Text size, Contrast\nSpeech rate, Voice, Reduced motion, Notifications]
    SET1 --> D
